# Peticiones de prueba. En Visual Studio aparece "Send request" encima de cada una.
# Antes: docker compose up -d  y arrancar la API (perfil "http").
@api = http://localhost:5163

### 1. Crear un envío → 201 Created. Copia el "trackingNumber" y el "shipmentId" de la respuesta.
POST {{api}}/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender": {
    "name": "Ana López",
    "phone": "81 1234 5678",
    "address": { "street": "Av. Constitución 100", "city": "Monterrey", "state": "Nuevo León", "postalCode": "64000", "country": "MX" }
  },
  "recipient": {
    "name": "Luis Pérez",
    "phone": "+52 33 9876 5432",
    "address": { "street": "Calle Juárez 5", "city": "Guadalajara", "state": "Jalisco", "postalCode": "44100", "country": "MX" }
  },
  "weightKg": 5,
  "lengthCm": 30,
  "widthCm": 20,
  "heightCm": 10
}

### 2. Consultar por número de guía → 200 (pega aquí el tuyo)
@trackingNumber = PFXXXXXXXXXX
GET {{api}}/api/shipments/tracking/{{trackingNumber}}

### 3. Cancelar → 204. Repetirla da 409 (ya cancelado).
@shipmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{api}}/api/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "El cliente ya no lo necesita" }

### 4. Peso inválido → 400 con "code" y "field"
POST {{api}}/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender": { "name": "Ana", "phone": "8112345678", "address": { "street": "A 1", "city": "MTY", "state": "NL", "postalCode": "64000", "country": "MX" } },
  "recipient": { "name": "Luis", "phone": "3398765432", "address": { "street": "B 2", "city": "GDL", "state": "JAL", "postalCode": "44100", "country": "MX" } },
  "weightKg": 80, "lengthCm": 30, "widthCm": 20, "heightCm": 10
}

### 5. Documento OpenAPI
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json

### ───────────── Listado de envíos (CQRS: proyección + paginación) ─────────────
GET {{api}}/api/shipments?status=Registered&search=monterrey&page=1&pageSize=10

### ───────────── Tracking ─────────────
# Tras crear un envío, Tracking lo recibe por evento (outbox) en una fracción de segundo.
GET {{api}}/api/tracking/{{trackingNumber}}

### Registrar movimiento (manuales: PickedUp → InTransit → AtDistributionCenter)
POST {{api}}/api/tracking/{{trackingNumber}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PickedUp", "location": "Monterrey", "description": "Recolectado en domicilio" }

### Al registrar AtDistributionCenter, Deliveries crea la entrega pendiente.
POST {{api}}/api/tracking/{{trackingNumber}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "AtDistributionCenter", "location": "CEDIS Guadalajara", "description": "Recibido en el centro" }

### ───────────── Deliveries ─────────────
GET {{api}}/api/deliveries?status=Pending

### Pega el "id" de la entrega
@deliveryId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{api}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}

### Asignar repartidor → Tracking pasa a OutForDelivery
POST {{api}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courierId": "REP-014" }

### Intento fallido (RecipientAbsent, WrongAddress, Refused, Inaccessible, Other)
POST {{api}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/fail
Content-Type: application/json

{ "failureCode": "RecipientAbsent" }

### Confirmar entrega → Tracking y Shipments pasan a Delivered
POST {{api}}/api/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "receivedBy": "Luis Pérez", "notes": "Recepción del edificio" }

### ───────────── Dashboard (composición de los 3 módulos) ─────────────
GET {{api}}/api/dashboard
